    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of one cargo compartment smoke sampling installation, showing the sampling run, the condensate trap, the detector interface and the routing hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of one cargo compartment smoke sampling installation, from the sampling points to the detector inlet. Use it to order sampling line items, traps and routing hardware.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the forward compartment run and sheet 2 the aft and bulk runs, which differ in length but use the same parts. Item 10 is the condensate trap valve kit fitted with the dual loop standard, and item 10A is the regulator it replaced. On dual loop aircraft every item in this figure is fitted twice per compartment, once on each loop, and the two loops share no support."
    },
